-- Q6 ACK  — SPAN/5 IS EMITTED (A″): when a node's metadata carries ALL FOUR of
--           line/column/endLine/endColumn as JSON integers (fitting i64), they
--           collapse into one span(E, l, c, el, ec) Composite fact; nodes with
--           a partial subset keep individual per-key facts. BOTH totals
--           pre-registered below; the real-base run pins which shipped.
