--           The R-1a seeded pair is set as author_priority on ALL five decls.
--           conflict/5 emitted per predicate. Pre-registered per-predicate
--           counts below. OQ-5 DISSOLUTION recorded: in the per-key-predicate
--           layout every metadata key is its own predicate, so every
--           Functional subject is plain c0 — the attr/3 compound (id,key)
--           subject question no longer exists.
-- Q8 ACK  — VARIANT A pinned: no edge_of/3; edge-metadata facts keyed by the
--           computed EID and ROUTED by their own subject (the EID), i.e. NOT
--           colocated with the src node's shard — accepted: metadata preds
--           have no reverse runs and no locality contract in the doc.
-- Q9 ACK  — output shard_count = input db_config.json value = 16, recorded in
--           the manifest. Reshard out of scope (§5.2: creation-time constant).
-- Q10 ACK — losers stay LIVE (read-time resolution, §2.3); the winner is NOT
--           physically privileged. §10.3 step 5 says «вместо того, чтобы
--           оставить первого» — emit the conflict, keep both; supersession of
--           losers would erase the arbitration §4.2 wants queryable.
