-- ══ NON-CLAIMS (honest boundary) ══
--
-- N1 NO cross-model sha equality vs the old base: P2-P5 speak base-five
--    attr/3, the converter speaks the 141-predicate vocabulary — different
--    logical fact sets BY DESIGN. C1 record-level round-trip is the honest
--    equivalence instrument.
-- N2 NO engine query over the converted store (Q3). NO compaction, NO
--    supersession, NO write path beyond the converter itself.
-- N3 C2/C3-full/C4/C5/C6/C8 are stage-2+ items BY NAME (see stage split).
--
-- Wallclock, actual fact counts, growth factors, conflict counts, sha values
-- and the mechanical test-count diff land in round-012.rofl (separate commit).
